.direnv

# Resolved, not pinned. The committed lock recorded `dart: ">=3.11.0"` from the
# Mac's SDK, which the tfc-toolchain container (Dart 3.10.1) cannot satisfy --
# so pub re-resolved on every CI build and the versions on the stick were never
# the versions in the file. A lock that cannot be honoured is worse than none:
# it reads as a pin. The root package gitignores its lock for the same reason.
app/pubspec.lock
